'''Exercise 3.3 — This snippet attempts to print the zipped pairs twice. Explain why the second
print produces no output, and fix it:'''

a = [1, 2, 3]
b = ['x', 'y', 'z']
z = zip(a, b)
print(*z)
print(*z)  # nothing prints!


a = [1, 2, 3]
b = ['x', 'y', 'z']
z = list(zip(a, b))   # now z is a list, not an iterator
print(*z)
print(*z)  


